<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Holy Grasp</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Paladin (guild level 120, up to 80%)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast holy grasp &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast holy grasp</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A stronger prayer than holy touch: the paladin speaks the liturgy of the 
gods and grasps the target, and those who lean to evil are hurt badly. Any target whose alignment is below 0 can be 
struck, even a neutral who leans to evil, and the truly evil are hurt more; 
on anyone of alignment 0 or above, nothing happens. The better 
your divine power and your skill in the spell, the more it hurts. It hurts most through clothes and least through plate, 
which takes about a third less, and a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while 
fighting. It is also found on scrolls. 
The strongest of these prayers is holy shout.
</p><p><br />
